] <b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.663\">vb.</abbr></b> cut, (divide,) determine (so Targum Syr., in both mngs.; BH <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.660\">usu.</abbr> <i>divide,</i> † Jb Est <i>decree</i>);—<b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.491\">Pe</abbr></b>. <i>Pt. act.</i> as <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.619\">subst.</abbr>, <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.505\">pl.</abbr> abs. <span class=\"hebrew\">גָּֽזְרִין</span> <i>determiners</i> (of fate; astrologers or soothsayers) <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan2:27\">Dn 2:27</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan5:11\">5:11</a>; emph. <span class=\"hebrew\">גָּֽזְרַיָּא</span> <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan4:4\">4:4</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan5:7\">5:7</a> (cf. <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.160\">Dr</abbr>.; <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.454\">Ar.</abbr> <span class=\"arabic\">جزّار</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.545\">RS<sup>JPhil</sup></abbr>. xiii (1885), 781). <b>Hithpe.</b> <i><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.500\">Pf.</abbr></i> 3 fs. <span class=\"hebrew\">הִתְגְּזֶרֶת</span> <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan2:34\">2:34</a> a stone <i>was cut out,</i> so ´<span class=\"hebrew\">אִתְג</span>: (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.316\">K<sup>§</sup></abbr> § 23, 1; 30, 2) v:<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan2:45\">45</a> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.380\">c.</abbr> <span class=\"hebrew\">מִן</span> of source).</p> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">1510</span>]</abbr> † [<span class=\"hebrew\">גְּזֵרָה</span>] <b>n. f.</b> decree (Targum <span class=\"hebrew\">גְּזֵירָא</span>, Syr. <span class=\"syriac\">ܓܙܝܪܐ</span>);—cstr. <span class=\"hebrew\">גְּזֵרַת</span> <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan4:14\">Dn 4:14</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan4:21\">4:21</a>.</p></blockquote>",
