<span class=\"hebrew\">גְּלָה</span>] <b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.663\">vb.</abbr></b> reveal (BH <span class=\"hebrew\">גָּלָה</span> <i>uncover, reveal</i>);—<b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.491\">Pe</abbr>.</b> <i>reveal</i> secrets, human agent: <i>Inf.</i> <span class=\"hebrew\">לְמִגְלֵא</span> <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan2:47\">Dn 2:47</a>; of God, <i>Pt. act.</i> <span class=\"hebrew\">גָּלֵא</span> v:<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan2:22\">22</a>, v:<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan2:28\">28</a>, v:<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan2:29\">29</a>, v:<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan2:47\">47</a>. <b>Pₑ‘îl</b> <i><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.500\">Pf.</abbr></i> <span class=\"hebrew\">גֲּלִי</span> v:<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan2:19\">19</a>, <span class=\"hebrew\">גֱּלִי</span> v:<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan2:30\">30</a>, <i>revealed</i> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.674\">W<sup>CG</sup></abbr> 225 <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.450\">Nö<sup>LCB</sup></abbr>, 1896, 703);—of secret, <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.380\">c.</abbr> <span class=\"hebrew\">ל</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.498\">Pers.</abbr> <b>Haph.</b> <i>take into exile</i> (BH <b>Hiph.</b>), <i><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.500\">Pf.</abbr></i> 3 ms. <span class=\"hebrew\">הַגְלִי</span>, <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.380\">c.</abbr> acc. <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.498\">Pers.</abbr> <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezra4:10\">Ezr 4:10</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezra5:12\">5:12</a> (<span class=\"hebrew\">ל</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.393\">loc.</abbr>).</p> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">1547,1473</span>]</abbr> † [<span class=\"hebrew\">גָּלוּ</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.316\">K<sup>§</sup></abbr> 61. 4] <b>n. f.</b> exile;—emph. <span class=\"hebrew\">בְּגֵי גָלוּתָא</span> i.e. exiles, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezra6:16\">Ezr 6:16</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan2:25\">Dn 2:25</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan5:13\">5:13</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan6:14\">6:14</a> (cf. BH <span class=\"hebrew\">גּוֺלָה</span>).</p></blockquote>",
