owing; BH II. <span class=\"hebrew\">גלל</span>; Palm. <span class=\"hebrew\">גללא</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.401\">Lzb<sup>250</sup></abbr> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.558\">SAC<sup>36</sup></abbr> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.116\">Cooke<sup>334</sup></abbr>, = <span class=\"greek\">στήλη λιθίνη</span>).</p> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">1560</span>]</abbr> † <span class=\"hebrew\">גְּלָל</span> <b>n. [m.]</b> rolling;—abs. ´<span class=\"hebrew\">אֶבֶן ג</span>: <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezra5:8\">Ezr 5:8</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezra6:4\">6:4</a> <i>stones of rolling,</i> too heavy for carrying.</p></blockquote> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">1535</span>]</abbr> † [<span class=\"hebrew\">גַּלְגַּל</span>] <b>n. m.</b> wheel (Targum BH; Syr. <span class=\"syriac\">ܓܝܓܠ</span>);—<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.505\">pl.</abbr> sf. <span class=\"hebrew\">גַּלְגִּלּוֺהִ֫י</span> <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan7:9\">Dn 7:9</a> of throne-chariot of God.</p></blockquote> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">4039–40</span>]</abbr> † <span class=\"hebrew\">מְגִלָּה</span> <b>n. f.</b> (book-) roll (Targum BH);—<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezra6:2\">Ezr 6:2</a>.</p></blockquote>",
