"content": "<style> body { margin: 0; color: #1d1d1b; background: #fbfaf7; font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif; line-height: 1.55; } main { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px 80px; } .document-header { border-bottom: 2px solid #1d1d1b; margin-bottom: 28px; padding-bottom: 16px; } h1, h2, h3 { line-height: 1.2; margin: 0; } h1 { font-size: 2rem; } .bdb-entry { border-top: 1px solid #bbb4a8; padding: 26px 0 8px; } .article-header { margin-bottom: 18px; } .article-header h2 { align-items: baseline; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; font-size: 1.55rem; } .bdb-subentry { margin: 18px 0 24px; padding-left: 18px; border-left: 4px solid #d4c8ad; } .bdb-subentry h3 { align-items: baseline; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; font-size: 1.15rem; } .bdb-code { color: #6a4f1c; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 0.82em; } .headwords, .hebrew { font-family: \"SBL Hebrew\", \"Ezra SIL\", \"Times New Roman\", serif; } .section-definition, .article-definition { color: #57524a; margin: 6px 0 10px; } .entry-meta { color: #5d5a54; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; gap: 6px 14px; margin: 8px 0 10px; } .entry-meta span { white-space: nowrap; } p.p { margin: 10px 0; } .strongs-number { color: #785f28; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; } .ref { color: #245f73; } .arabic, .syriac, .samaritan, .persian { direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: isolate; } .unmapped-entries { border-top: 2px solid #8c7b61; margin-top: 36px; padding-top: 24px; } .ethiopic { font-family: \"Abyssinica SIL\", \"GFF Amharic\", serif; } .greek { font-family: \"GFS Porson\", \"Gentium Plus\", \"Times New Roman\", serif; } blockquote { margin-left: 2em; } .strongs-number { vertical-align: super; font-size: smaller; } </style> <p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">1585,1584</span>]</abbr> † [<span class=\"hebrew\">גְּמַר</span>] <b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.663\">vb.</abbr></b> complete (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.468\">oft.</abbr> Targum Syr.; rare BH);—<b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.491\">Pe</abbr>.</b> <i>Pt. <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.489\">pass.</abbr></i> <span class=\"hebrew\">גְּמִיר</span> <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezra7:12\">Ezr 7:12</a> as adj. <i>perfect</i> (read perh. ´<span class=\"hebrew\">שְׁלָם ג</span>:, Torrey <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.57\">Berthol</abbr>; cf. <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezra5:7\">5:7</a>).</p> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">1595–96</span>]</abbr> † [<span class=\"hebrew\">גְּנַז</span>] <b>n. m.</b>:<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezra6:1\">Ezr 6:1</a> treasure (Targum; v. BH [<span class=\"hebrew\">גְּנָזִים</span>], sub <span class=\"hebrew\">גנז</span>);—<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.505\">pl.</abbr> emph. <span class=\"hebrew\">גִּנְזִיָּא</span> <i>treasures</i> <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezra6:1\">Ezr 6:1</a>, <span class=\"hebrew\">דִּי מַלְכָּא בֵּית</span> ´<span class=\"hebrew\">ג</span>: <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezra5:17\">5:17</a>, cstr. <span class=\"hebrew\">בֵּית גִּנְזֵי מִלְכָּא</span> <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Ezra7:20\">7:20</a>.</p></blockquote> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">1611,102</span>]</abbr> † [<span class=\"hebrew\">גַּף</span>] <b>n. f.</b>: <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan7:4\">Dn 7:4</a> wing of bird (Targum <span class=\"hebrew\">גַּף</span>, <span class=\"hebrew\">גַּפְּא</span>, <span class=\"hebrew\">גַּנְפָּא</span> (? <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.123\">D<sup>WB</sup></abbr> 79), Syr. <span class=\"syriac\">ܓܦܐ</span>; akin to BH <span class=\"hebrew\">אֲגַף</span>, <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.17\">As.</abbr> <i>aggapu ?</i> acc. to <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.450\">Nö<sup>M</sup></abbr> 77 (cf. <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.407\">Mand.</abbr> <span class=\"hebrew\">גאדפא</span>, Targum <span class=\"hebrew\">גַּדְפָּא</span>), Id<sup>GGA</sup>, 1884, 1019, √ <span class=\"hebrew\">גִדף</span>, <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.454\">Ar.</abbr> <span class=\"arabic\">جَدَفَ</span>, <span class=\"arabic\">جَدَفَ</span> <i>fly, row</i> (but this loan-word <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.199\">Frä<sup>227</sup></abbr>));—<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.505\">pl.</abbr> abs. <i>wings,</i> <span class=\"hebrew\">גַּפִּין</span> <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan7:4\">Dn 7:4</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan7:6\">7:6</a>; sf. <span class=\"hebrew\">גַּפִּיהּ</span> v:<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan7:4\">4</a> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.359\">Kt</abbr> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.523\">Qr</abbr> sg. <span class=\"hebrew\">נַּפַּהּ</span>).</p></blockquote> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">1634–35</span>]</abbr> † [<span class=\"hebrew\">גְּרַם</span>] <b>n. [m.]</b> bone (BH <span class=\"hebrew\">גֶּ֫רֶם</span>; <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.106\">Chr-Pal.</abbr> <span class=\"syriac\">ܓܪܡ</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.578\">Schulth<sup>Lex</sup></abbr>. 46);—<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.505\">pl.</abbr> sf. <span class=\"hebrew\">גַּרְמֵיהוֺן</span> <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan6:25\">Dn 6:25</a>.</p></blockquote> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">1653,1655</span>]</abbr> † [<span class=\"hebrew\">גְּשֵׁם</span>] <b>n. m.</b>:<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan4:30\">Dn 4:30</a> body (v. √ <span class=\"hebrew\">גשׁם</span> in BH; Targum<sup>J</sup> <span class=\"hebrew\">גּוּשְׁמָא</span>, <span class=\"hebrew\">גִּשְׁמָא</span> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.123\">D<sup>WB</sup></abbr> 83), Syr. <span class=\"syriac\">ܓܘܫܡܐ</span>, <i>body, self</i>);—<i>body</i> of man, sf. <span class=\"hebrew\">גִּשְׁמֵהּ</span> <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan4:30\">Dn 4:30</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan5:21\">5:21</a>, so <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.505\">pl.</abbr> sf. <span class=\"hebrew\">גַּשְׁמַיהוֺן</span> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.316\">K<sup>§</sup></abbr> 15 a) <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan3:27\">3:27</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Dan3:28\">3:28</a>, both <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.359\">Kt</abbr>, <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.523\">Qr</abbr> sg. <span class=\"hebrew\">גֶּשְׁמֵהוֺן</span> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.316\">K<sup>§</sup></abbr> 54, 3 <i>b</i>)).</p></blockquote>",
